Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.70,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}He taught each of them one thing.\NHe never told them why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.90,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}He had 5 months.\NHe spent every day getting them ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.60,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}20 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:02.40,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}ANNA: {\i1}(laughing){\i0} Why do I need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: {\i1}(smiling){\i0} Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:07.80,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: Over, under, through. Now you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.50,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: One, two, three…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:13.00,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}MIA: {\i1}(giggling){\i0} You have to dance with me at my wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:17.80,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: {\i1}(quietly){\i0} …I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}ANNA: Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.80,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: {\i1}(too quickly){\i0} Practising a speech. Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:34.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SAM: {\i1}(whispering){\i0} Over, under, through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:46.50,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: {\i1}(recording){\i0} Hey, baby girl… I'm sorry I'm not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:49.40,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: {\i1}(recording){\i0} But I promised you a dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:52.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}MIA: {\i1}(whispering){\i0} One, two, three…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:56.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: {\i1}(recording){\i0} Sam… take care of her for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:58.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DANIEL: {\i1}(recording){\i0} Anna… thank you for staying brave.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.00,0:01:05.00,End,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,780)\fad(900,500)}He couldn't stay.\NSo he made sure\Nthey'd be okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.80,0:01:05.00,End2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,500)}Hug your dad today.\NSay it out loud.
